        "MOFFEINHERETIC_SKILL_LUNAR_SECONDARY_REPLACEMENT_DESCRIPTION": "Sphaeram laminarum onera quae iterum atque iterum <style=cIsDamage>175% damni</style> infert. Post moram explodit, omnes hostes <style=cIsDamage>in loco figit</style> et <style=cIsDamage>700% damni</style> infert.",
